target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Columbia Library&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA; - List of tools and datasets aggregated by Columbia Library&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://guides.library.brandeis.edu/c.php?g=990410&amp;amp;p=7164687&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Brandeis Library&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA; - Aggregated list from Brandeis Library&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;</description>
